=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OyZx7TmZgZgQ7kNvwHFYlgC&_nc_oc=AdqUvi4Z35JiKdWYOIMus2MgTu2e4mX8unSxHXzwmppUVL1J_AwCI_SYQ8_Mq-cvLpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5BtSipa9mA2PvPpn4EyzNPijZL1D0iu7QzO8NuBZ4peQ&oe=6A01F14B"}, "display_name": "Zombieland: Headshot Fever", "keywords": ["Action", "Shooter", "FPS", "zombies", "Zombieland"], "long_description": "Zombieland VR: Headshot Fever is an arcade light-gun game built for VR.\n\nThis zombie-killing race sport brings light-gun games into the 21st century! Headshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy.\n\nThen perform on the world stage! Sign up for the inaugural Zombieland Invitational, in association with VR Master League, by visiting zombielandvrgame.com, and become the fastest zombie killer in the world! \n\nFEATURES\nBullet Time - Two headshots in a row makes the world slow, use it to your advantage\nLeaderboards - Challenge your friends, beat their times and climb the global leaderboards\nWeapons - Unlock and upgrade a range of weapons to improve your times\nShooting Range - Increase your skills before taking on the undead\nThe Zombieland Invitational - Take on the most dangerous zombie killing race course ever devised\n\nSet record times, challenge friends, then take on the leaderboards - WORLDWIDE", "short_description": "Zombieland VR: Headshot Fever is an arcade light-gun game built for VR. \n\nThis zombie-killing race sport brings light-gun games into the 21st century! Headshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy.\n\nThen perform on the world stage! Sign up for the inaugural Zombieland Invitational, in association with VR Master League, by visiting zombielandvrgame.com, and become the fastest zombie killer in the world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "ht